              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.5+REV.7.6+REV.7.7+REV.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.5",
              "REV.7.6",
              "REV.7.7",
              "REV.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After this I looked, and there was an enormous crowd — no one could count all the people! They were from every race, tribe, nation, and language, and they stood in front of the throne and of the Lamb, dressed in white robes and holding palm branches in their hands. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They called out in a loud voice: “Salvation comes from our God, who sits on the throne, and from the Lamb!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All the angels stood round the throne, the elders, and the four living creatures. Then they threw themselves face downwards in front of the throne and worshipped God, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "saying, “Amen! Praise, glory, wisdom, thanksgiving, honour, power, and might belong to our God for ever and ever! Amen!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
