            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.24.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mt 24.21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.13.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mk 13.19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“I don't know, sir. You do,” I answered.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He said to me, “These are the people who have come safely through the terrible persecution. They have washed their robes and made them white with the blood of the Lamb. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "That is why they stand before God's throne and serve him day and night in his temple. He who sits on the throne will protect them with his presence. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.49.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Is 49.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Never again will they hunger or thirst; neither sun nor any scorching heat will burn them, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
